      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "RAMSET READY (1) turned spotting a big start finishing sixth (30.66) last time in a Grade 5 at this track. Safe beginner who draws ideally on the inside. Can make amends. WELL READ (7) has been beaten for early speed lately, last time finishing fourth (23.61) in a Grade 5 at this track. Solid beginner and with a good start should have clear running out wide. Cannot be left out. MY ROADSTER BOY (6) racing well without winning, placing at his last five runs. Last time finished 2nd in a Grade 5 on August 2 over 320m at this track behind Winsome Willy beaten one length (18.40). Consistent performer from this draw with a win and two minor placings to his credit. Overdue and gets his chance. STUMPY JONES (4) gets a chance to redeem an unplaced effort here last start.",
